    id: "archive_warden",
    name: "Archive warden",
    summary: "The Archive's guardian at the galaxy's centre: four sections, each on cores of its own, that change their tactics as it breaks.",
    description: "Whole, it holds off at the reach of its fore section's [[part:torpedo_launcher|torpedoes]] and [[part:long_cannon|long cannons]], and backs away while a ward is down. Shoot a section off and the heart closes in to bring its [[part:beam_laser|beam lasers]] to bear; bring it down to about half and it charges. Every section runs on its own [[part:sentinel_core|sentinel cores]] and fights on alone, with the same rules. Its [[part:prism_ward|prism wards]] take laser fire whole and its wings' [[part:wide_shield_emitter|wide shields]], [[part:point_defence]] and [[part:ion_cannon|ion cannons]] cover its flanks, their cannons and rockets its back: bring guns, missiles and point defence, and radiators for the core's radiation.",
